  {
    "name": "jtoml",
    "group": "io.github.wasabithumb",
    "artifact": "jtoml",
    "coordinate": "io.github.wasabithumb:jtoml",
    "version": "1.8.3",
    "license": "Apache-2.0",
    "license_evidence": "Maven release POM licenses (jtoml, jtoml-api and jtoml-internals 1.8.3)",
    "input_api": "JToml.jToml().read(Path) -> TomlDocument (TomlTable); TomlPrimitive typed accessors; parse errors throw TomlParseException",
    "documentation": "https://javadoc.io/doc/io.github.wasabithumb/jtoml-api/1.8.3/io/github/wasabithumb/jtoml/JToml.html",
    "source": "https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/io/github/wasabithumb/jtoml/1.8.3/jtoml-1.8.3-sources.jar",
    "scope": "TOML 1.0.0 text from a local file into a TomlDocument of TomlTable/TomlArray/TomlPrimitive values with Long, Double, Boolean, String and java.time values",
    "family": "jtoml (WasabiThumb; own hand-written reader and expression parser in jtoml-internals, value model in jtoml-api)",
    "family_note": "jtoml 1.8.3 is split into three release artifacts: jtoml (the JToml entry point), jtoml-api (TomlTable/TomlArray/TomlPrimitive, keys, options, exceptions) and jtoml-internals (io.github.wasabithumb.jtoml.io reader and source/target streams, io.github.wasabithumb.jtoml.expression key/value/table expression parser). Runtime dependencies are only these three jars; org.jetbrains:annotations and org.jspecify:jspecify are compile-time annotations and are not installed. It does not use ANTLR, Jackson or another TOML library and shares no code with tomlj, Jackson TOML or NightConfig.",
    "configuration_note": "Default JTomlOptions. Keys are read with TomlTable.keys(false) (direct single-segment keys) and get(TomlKey); every scalar kind comes from TomlPrimitive's typed is*/as* accessors, so integer 1000 and float 1e3 and the four date-time kinds stay distinct.",
